===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of making a previously [[legal]] activity [[illegal]], the act of making something a criminal offence.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2014|author=Ummni Khan|title=Vicarious Kinks: S/M in the Socio-Legal Imaginary|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=8j7AAwAAQBAJ&pg=PT337&dq=%22breathplay%22|publisher=University of Toronto Press|isbn=9781442668102
|passage=And of course, s/m players who participate in breath play will also be more vulnerable to '''criminalization''' under such a new law.}}
# The act of turning someone into a [[criminal]] by making their activities illegal.

